@startuml BuildFlow_Activity_Diagram
title BuildFlow - System Activity Diagram (End-to-End Construction Workflow with Swimlanes)

|#AliceBlue|Project Owner|
start
:Initiates Project Scope & Budget;

|#LightYellow|Project Manager|
:Creates Milestone Tasks in Backlog;
:Establishes Gantt Timeline & Prerequisites;

fork
  |#MistyRose|Architect|
  :Uploads BIM/CAD Blueprints (v1.0);

  |#Lavender|Structural Engineer|
  :Performs Structural Load Calculations;
  if (Calculation Check) then (Passed)
    :Approves Drawing & Certifies Sign-Off;
  else (Failed)
    :Rejects Drawing with Revision Orders;
    |Architect|
    :Uploads Revised Drawing (v2.1);
    |Structural Engineer|
    :Approves Revised Drawing (v2.1);
  endif

fork again
  |#Honeydew|General Contractor|
  :Requests Bulk Material Batch (Steel/Concrete);

  |#PeachPuff|Material Supplier|
  :Dispatches Shipment from Warehouse;
  if (Logistics Transit) then (On Time)
    :Delivered to Site Drop-off Zone;
  else (Delayed)
    :Flags DELAYED Status at Customs;
    |Project Manager|
    :Logs Supply Disruption & Reschedules Crane;
    |Material Supplier|
    :Clears Customs & Delivers Rebar Batch;
  endif
end fork

|General Contractor|
:Commences Onsite Work Package;
:Moves Task to IN_PROGRESS on Kanban;

|#Plum|Safety Inspector|
:Conducts Onsite Safety & Structural Audit;

if (Inspection Verdict) then (PASSED)
  |General Contractor|
  :Task transitioned to DONE;
  |Project Manager|
  :System recalculates Project Progress %;
else (FAILED)
  |Safety Inspector|
  :Logs Non-Compliance Violation Ticket;
  |General Contractor|
  :Remediates Fire Barrier Penetration Sleeves;
  |Safety Inspector|
  :Re-inspects & Pass Audit;
  |General Contractor|
  :Task transitioned to DONE;
endif

|Project Owner|
:Views Executive KPIs & Exports Health Report;
stop
@enduml
